Dark vintage 1960s recording studio acoustic wall texture for a mobile phone app background, vertical portrait orientation (9:16). An almost black surface (#0f0a06) of oiled dark English walnut acoustic wood slats with fine vertical timber grain and dark acoustic grille texture. Extremely low contrast and very dark overall, ensuring cream text overlaid on top remains completely crisp and legible. A very faint, soft, dim warm amber tungsten light leak along the left edge and a faint warm bronze indicator glow leak along the right edge. Flat, even, front-on macro perspective, like a luxury studio material swatch. Absolutely no buttons, no dials, no text, no numbers, no logos, no people, no watermark.
